oes to make... on the foot Benefits of Training Shoes • Provide additional support for both forward and lateral movements • Designed for a variety of cross-training workouts, including HIIT, strength training, step aerobics, boot camps and short treadmill jogs • While not intended for use in long races (i.e., half marathons and marathons), our training shoes can be used in shorter runs (i.e., mile races and treadmill warm-ups) What payments do you accept? We accept the following payment options: Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, PayPal, and Afterpay. To save credit cards, debit cards, and gift cards for faster checkout, log in or create an account. How do I become a member? To become a member, create an account online by visiting our log in or create an account page and fill out the required information. Become a member for early access to promotions and to receive exclusive offers. Creating an account and becoming a member lets you easily track orders, check out faster, hear about promotions and new releases first. Can I buy something online and pick it up at my local New Balance store? Yes, a selection of products that are for sale on newbalance.com are also available in a New Balance store near you. To see pickup options during checkout, choose “Pick up in store” and use your zip code to select your local store. You can also set your store while shopping by using the store selector in the upper left hand corner or in the mobile menu. Shop the largest collection of New Balance footwear, apparel and accessories at the official New Balance online store.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
